WhatTheLoop minimal CLI

Usage: wtl <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run   Run one WTL loop for a single request
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
